  "content": "<h2 style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace;font-weight:bold\">介绍：</h2><p style=\"font-size:17px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace\">这个模组是一个库模组，包含了 jtorleon-studios-team 模组的共享代码。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2 style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace;font-weight:bold\">支持的模组加载器：</h2><p style=\"font-size:17px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace\">我们积极支持 Forge、NeoForge 和 Fabric 模组加载器，从 Minecraft 1.16.5 版本到最新版本。点击以下链接选择你喜欢的模组加载器：</p><div>\n<div style=\"background-color:#1a1a1a;color:#e5e5e5\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jtorleon-studios-team/.github/refs/heads/main/assets/modloaders/fabric-favicon-32x32.png\" width=\"60\"> <a style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace;text-decoration:none;line-height:60px;margin-left:5px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/library-ferret-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric 版本在这里 <span style=\"color:#f16436\">[点击我🔗]</span></a></div>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div style=\"background-color:#1a1a1a;color:#e5e5e5\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jtorleon-studios-team/.github/refs/heads/main/assets/modloaders/neoforge-favicon-32x32.png\" width=\"60\"> <a style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace;text-decoration:none;line-height:60px;margin-left:5px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/library-ferret-neoforge\" rel=\"nofollow\">NeoForge 版本在这里 <span style=\"color:#f16436\">[点击我🔗]</span></a></div>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><h2 style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace;font-weight:bold\">链接：</h2><p style=\"font-size:17px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace\">查找我们的资源并加入社区：</p><div style=\"background-color:#1a1a1a;color:#e5e5e5\"><a style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace;text-decoration:none;line-height:60px;margin-left:15px\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fjtorleon-studios-team.github.io%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> 🔗 链接树 </a></div><p>&nbsp;</p><div style=\"background-color:#1a1a1a;color:#e5e5e5\"><a style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace;text-decoration:none;line-height:60px;margin-left:15px\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fjtorleon-studios-team.github.io%252fdiscord.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> 🔗 Discord </a></div><p>&nbsp;</p><div style=\"background-color:#1a1a1a;color:#e5e5e5\"><a style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace;text-decoration:none;line-height:60px;margin-left:15px\" href=\"https://github.com/jtorleon-studios-team\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> 🔗 Github </a></div><p>&nbsp;</p><h2 style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace;font-weight:bold\">合作伙伴：</h2><p style=\"font-size:17px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace\">本项目由 BisectHosting 自豪地支持。查看他们的服务，轻松托管你的项目，享受高质量和可靠性。</p><div style=\"background-color:#1a1a1a;color:#e5e5e5\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fjtl\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/789de297-fbf1-423b-aa14-990433cf8f58.webp\" alt=\"banner bisechosting\" width=\"1086\" height=\"180\"> </a></div><p>&nbsp;</p><h2 style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace;font-weight:bold\">行动号召：</h2><p style=\"font-size:17px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace\">有问题吗？需要帮助？加入我们的 Discord 或访问我们的 GitHub，参与社区并贡献你的力量！</p>",
